{"id": "section-body-20629", "title": "Diabetic Retinopathy", "chapterId": "chapter-nineteen", "blocks": [{"id": "body-20629", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Diabetic Retinopathy", "runs": [{"text": "Diabetic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Retinopathy"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "924"}}, {"id": "body-20630", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "It is one of the major causes of blindness. Poor glycemic control, nephropathy, hypertension and pregnancy, long duration of diabetes are among the risk factors. It is preventable and its progression retarded by improved glycemic control and blood pressure. Screening for early detection and laser therapy can prevent blindness", "runs": [{"text": "It is one of the major causes of blindness. Poor glycemic control, nephropathy, hypertension and pregnancy, long duration of diabetes are among the risk factors. It is preventable and its progression retarded by improved glycemic control and blood pressure. Screening for early detection and laser therapy can prevent blindness"}]}, {"id": "body-20632", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Screening for Diabetic Retinopathy", "runs": [{"text": "Screening"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Diabetic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Retinopathy"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-20633", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "For all people with diabetes, yearly screening is necessary for early detection of ocular complications. The screening should begin:", "runs": [{"text": "For all people with diabetes, yearly screening is necessary for early detection of ocular complications. The screening should "}, {"text": "begin:"}]}, {"id": "body-20635", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Comprehensive eye examination in woman planning pregnancy, and during the first trimester, preferably at booking of antenatal clinic (ANC). Further screening should be determined by the degree of retinopathy detected at the initial appointment.", "runs": [{"text": "Comprehensive eye examination in woman planning pregnancy, and during the first trimester, preferably at booking of antenatal clinic (ANC). Further screening should be determined by the degree of retinopathy detected at the initial "}, {"text": "appointment."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "864"}}, {"id": "body-20636", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "\nFive years after the diagnosis of diabetes for individuals with Type 1 diabetes diagnosed after puberty (around 14years).", "runs": [{"text": "\n"}, {"text": "Five years after the diagnosis of diabetes for individuals with Type 1 diabetes diagnosed after puberty (around 14years)."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "864"}}, {"id": "body-20637", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "At puberty for individuals diagnosed with type 1 diabetes before puberty", "runs": [{"text": "At puberty for individuals diagnosed with type 1 diabetes before puberty"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "864"}}, {"id": "body-20638", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "At the time of diagnosis of diabetes for individuals with type 2 diabetes", "runs": [{"text": "At the time of diagnosis of diabetes for individuals with type 2 diabetes"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "864"}}, {"id": "body-20640", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "For each of the scheduled screening visits, detailed patient’s assessment should include a complete ophthalmic examination in the following steps:", "runs": [{"text": "For each of the scheduled screening visits, detailed patient’s assessment should include a complete ophthalmic examination in the following steps:"}]}, {"id": "body-20642", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Take visual acuity (VA) without and with spectacles", "runs": [{"text": "Take"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "visual"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "acuity"}, {"text": "